  "instructions": [
    "Heat the shortening in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the beef to the pot and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the onion and garlic to the pot and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the bhuna sauce, tomato sauce, fish sauce, and black pepper to the pot and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve the kaldereta hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro if desired."
